"The center of mass of point masses \\(m_i\\) at positions \\(x_i\\) is the mass weighted average position (§{#}),",
"\\[x_\\text{cm} = \\frac{\\sum m_i x_i}{M}, \\qquad M = \\sum m_i,\\]",
